2026-07-27T08:20:51.6376394Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6437912Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6438689Z i /tmp/RtmpUeciCh/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6439237Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6439862Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6440718Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6441614Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6442837Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6443790Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6684596Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:51.6796473Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:51.7214797Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:20:51.7362403Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
